Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:53.87,Title,,0,0,0,,THE WORLD'S FIRST PODCAST
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:00.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,My happy place is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,my aunt's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:03.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,How my aunt's house
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:04.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:06.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,When you walk inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:09.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,there are tiles on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.14,0:00:09.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:11.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,She has guest rooms
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:14.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,for when I sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.26,0:00:14.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:17.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Of course, a baby
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:18.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,room for my little
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.38,0:00:18.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:21.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,She also has an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,outside pool and a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:24.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,guest house
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.68,0:00:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,in her backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:29.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Her house is new,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:31.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,so she's still building
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:31.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.46,0:00:34.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's a beautiful house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:35.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,How her house makes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:36.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,me feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:37.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Okay, this is sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:38.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,How her house makes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.42,0:00:38.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,me feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:40.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Her house makes me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.82,0:00:43.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,feel calm, safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:45.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,happy, loved, excited,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.89,0:00:49.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,welcomed, which is weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:50.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,because I don't think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.31,0:00:50.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,you guys are that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.73,0:00:50.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,welcoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.83,0:00:52.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,I've accused you of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.59,0:00:52.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.39,0:00:53.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,And more.
